Prompt not found in history: s_deadbeef
No authorship note on this machine has a prompt or session with that ID.

Where to find a prompt ID:
  autter blame <file>               legend of the prompts behind AI lines
  autter blame --why <file>:<line>  the prompt behind one line
  autter show <commit>              the raw note, prompts and sessions included

Notes made on other machines arrive with `autter fetch-notes`.
